{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>USJ×惡靈古堡安魂曲合作週邊一次介紹！除了鏈鋸人之外，史努比及三麗鷗也變成殭屍</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/204fa81c4ddd3386ae77f748a755c55ace999d00904b827b11292891408f1dd7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F67706331f9a516a16ce750f91074d185.jpg\"/><p>日本環球影城 (以下簡稱USJ)自2026年9月10日(四)起正在舉辦「 萬聖驚魂夜 」。 與CAPCOM的「 惡靈古堡安魂曲 (Resident Evil Requiem)」合作的餐點及遊樂設施正在展開，當然也有週邊商品！</p><h3>4-D電影商品屋新推出「惡靈古堡安魂曲」合作週邊！</h3><p>2位主角迎接</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1cd8adafb169eed4d2bd61e78d2949ccce834372d93165f1028d3b4352f5d4d6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff1769c29ff39620d1e5969243966da6e.jpg\"/><p>在入口正面迎接的是印有里昂與葛蕾斯的T恤！</p><p>※非賣品</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a9693fbb72412be4539a3557df34bd724e78b65d84ea708f863abd203957d7d7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc141917df4a4a1bb5a9a7d59c6248393.jpg\"/><p>・・・以及 The Girl的手臂 ！</p><p>※這也非賣品</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4dffccb08b86f216163e457047ce018fb1082670e81a741cd91bacac34685f78/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2d8567c2689d0e0778ea163882ed420d.jpg\"/><p>・・・以及 打字機 ！ 至少希望店內是安全地帶。</p><p>也有時尚的襯衫及夾克</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5f4aabdd7a471beb147cc2aeba5cff049594d117878eafca3808b77ea4d54962/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F21149a543b079bf980d6a65d7b96580e.jpg\"/><p>抬頭一看，新週邊陳列於此。</p><p>※這果然也非賣品</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/abfffff7b5308f1c68cd3ba0fbe51f8d303fecaea406fee8658fa3bc61b8d8fe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F957ac31b2038319d2458f59702e5b3bd.jpg\"/><p>這裡有 綠色藥草 ！ 進店後第一眼就覺得這在發光的人，是優秀的惡靈古堡玩家。</p><p>那麼前言就到這裡，讓我們詳細看看新週邊吧。</p><h3>里昂・S・甘乃迪/葛蕾斯・艾許考福特 / T恤(黑)</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/67fbf24ce48f3f16f073894cd395d535458752bbd14c1f06c145a2f82f78db96/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa4f397f537ad61862b1f7fc551f3aeea.jpg\"/><p>價格: 4,700日圓(含稅)</p><h3>里昂・S・甘乃迪/葛蕾斯・艾許考福特 / T恤(白)</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/53b9c5ce845acf606ad9767905bee6afdd64e080d11942ba0f9ffb58c0347079/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc9efdbdc334bbff10c32075eb5494866.jpg\"/><p>價格: 4,700日圓(含稅)</p><h3>R.P.D. / 襯衫</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5ef4165fa9cf8ab99d44226b866d8bbeb28f6c59b73ae570b950c8244a3c7faf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc94968321cc263c457bfd5b63f57dcac.jpg\"/><p>價格: 7.500日圓(含稅)</p><h3>DSO / 鋪棉夾克</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/12bdfae215f1fca96e142828e2be06d5cf1142d10338162ea1492c81ffc3287c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd49443791b5b0085e3e43e487374cb64.jpg\"/><p>價格: 15,000日圓(含稅)</p><h3>BSAA / 槍套腰帶包</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/10707a8b8d8533425d81453e354027c2e202cdf15b6130f0c0671f34b7094d6c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbb055f7b26e495971098df6731f9eb78.jpg\"/><p>價格: 6,900日圓(含稅)</p><h3>R.P.D. / 帽子</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/faf5c48b217bca0f384efae13d604e8d374325c344ebc136e6650ad321c81939/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F142d742c45a7faaabc9b663ac518bfac.jpg\"/><p>價格: 4,800日圓(含稅)</p><h3>殭屍犬 / 髮箍</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/63f83da85a431647e7567d694e268a0c0898519d20601eac98f3e9e3ab0edf2e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F75f93100a0132a986dd19b0b06aab6e4.jpg\"/><p>價格: 3,300日圓(含稅)</p><h3>R.P.D. / 3WAY包</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/40883a3c30526509b9049deca51d948bc314f702622e86b901d5cfcf60f271a3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F172cbcaee2d6e2b33810b6ac49a2f885.jpg\"/><p>價格: 6,200日圓(含稅)</p><h3>R.P.D. / 裝置收納盒</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/348c48adf7cadc801e704413cfcf295548020866fe980fff1c5dc1940acb06c3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F120f1edd4139a9eaad2086256651743c.jpg\"/><p>價格: 3,300日圓(含稅)</p><h3>BSAA / 附臂帶票卡套</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c5116466a3a5ef1edddac41a32a4100a52342cc8be3045bed46da8b66a99e809/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8d6a8ad42e49f5011567eed1af0d01ff.jpg\"/><p>價格: 1,400日圓(含稅)</p><h3>BSAA / 洗臉毛巾</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9f00acf446cdabc7448f035c2c6b19f7dda89245f6b0bf775b196ced2bf05116/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F54e4ab05ce5af0fc1ce29bf6127279ef.jpg\"/><p>價格: 2,100日圓(含稅)</p><h3>里昂・S・甘乃迪/葛蕾斯・艾許考福特 / 洗臉毛巾</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/df56059ed639e755e5669579199f98ae4c5e08e3a81924d2d322a4cf18feaa43/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9274161c74d3f1c0925f3dae95693b82.jpg\"/><p>價格: 2,000日圓(含稅)</p><h3>BSAA/U.B.C.S. / 鑰匙圈套組(2個)</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/37c3ac32e60406a76fd10d3cd3f1d66ace050087993051ec6ead251dbbad13e6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe8d1a40042622ef857b060539a79a79d.jpg\"/><p>價格: 2,000日圓(含稅)</p><h3>U.B.C.S. / 不鏽鋼隨行杯</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8edfc63f6fba344956e8f4da06c88d4423e82fe69e8c51edb6ccc98c915f42a9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe2f6c7e20abb4e286d9137c1f544c04b.jpg\"/><p>價格: 3,200日圓(含稅)</p><h3>舔食者 / 面紙袋</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/927825c621e347e420b7c34fb8b6857259868beb75b1c96648332e403345d96a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4a43948bf7a9e3d95f1ff50200ee696e.jpg\"/><p>價格: 3,000日圓(含稅)</p><h3>R.P.D. / 便條架</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/763bac33f36c0d91a235626cbeaf73b93e2e2ee5d488b3e40fe0ce18de181277/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd6242c36c2d77155fced757b1d281bda.jpg\"/><p>價格: 2,000日圓(含稅)</p><h3>浣熊先生 / 鑰匙圈</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7f0a777922fbdbc2cb1739376747d0e0b823c0ac8fb313be8dbc720e5a76f248/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4de8c6d342d28a44e5dccae4637e904a.jpg\"/><p>價格: 1,600日圓(含稅)</p><h3>收藏絨毛玩偶鑰匙圈(全6種・隨機)</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3b0ace11df1f8d5a4cf81943053df3682c7f31349acb6c5448037cc68269d35e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff89e74f90e4f5249cc710918febd8e2f.jpg\"/><p>價格: 各1,900日圓(含稅)</p><h3>還有惡靈古堡30週年紀念紀念幣(全3種)！</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/107698d9a9bce5cc713a079d898d4034b6e74a2be71fdbeb7cec86e45d783937/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffd4795337b1110ca0a3340c6d783291f.jpg\"/><p>價格: 各200日圓(含稅)</p><h3>除了惡靈古堡之外，「鏈鋸人」「史努比」等也以萬聖節樣式登場！</h3><p>波奇塔的週邊很多！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5a77adb8a0360169b409d5c6e1a2a90ab45a641bb35bfd8037f977d560398fec/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6420451c351be0feb5586723d38452ba.jpg\"/><p>USJ的萬聖節不僅只有惡靈古堡。</p><p>藝術風萬聖節設計的「 鏈鋸人 」週邊。 備齊了日常使用也很亮眼的繽紛商品。</p><p>被繃帶與 DENGER 層層纏繞的波奇塔太可愛了・・・！</p><p>也有殭屍週邊！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e880b7b9aed98b976487ae603d7893aca1381efca4e0933d9e5c2f894e5927d4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F54300cd2b4615dcec7d3ea46b29e613d.jpg\"/><p>而說到「萬聖驚魂夜」，果然 殭屍 不可或缺。 或許能從多樣的殭屍中找到自己的推？</p><p>皺眉表情</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2e27401ca9ab440e63c8a42713beedea613519e6438d246dd8ed44b885d414d9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3e0b33113335cbae79b3a4a35d8369c5.jpg\"/><p>平時在USJ能遇到的角色們的週邊也有！</p><p>「 花生漫畫 」的史努比與查理變成罕見的拼布殭屍造型。</p><p>可愛。可愛。可愛。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a9aa5a75cad47ff5b1ed6a27b3552dad7dc2c74dbe0b140b57371ed2a0c8c89e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F96fbea8887dc073748e546a51d0e635e.jpg\"/><p>「 三麗鷗 」的Hello Kitty、美樂蒂、庫洛米呈現可愛又帶哥德氛圍的風格。</p><p>熟悉的角色們變成萬聖節設計！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/530e9a0e5ace7efc66957c1569989fc2397f6ea21b8062c42571462291ead311/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fro%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa53b2a5e2930d55fffdc9248ddb8fda2.jpg\"/><p>「 Minions 」則有Bob等人及Tim的陣容！ 即使變成黑白或綠色，可愛度依然不變。</p><p>馬上入手限定週邊，享受USJ的「萬聖驚魂夜」吧！</p><p>🔸「TGS2026」CAPCOM攤位追加試玩作品公開！Switch 2版Monster Hunter Wilds及SF6新角色「阿爾俊」可搶先遊玩！ 🔸「Monster Hunter Wilds」Nintendo Switch 2版確定於12月4日(五)發售！2027年1月7日(四)前特別價格HKD223 🔸USJ×《惡靈古堡安魂曲》聯名美食＆遊樂設施先行體驗！Q版舔食者又噁又可愛 🔸「SF6」搏擊證「準備迎接阿爾俊吧！」開始發佈！電影「快打旋風／THE MOVIE」合作亂入視覺圖也同步發放中 🔸「街頭霸王6」Year 4追加角色第2回「阿爾俊」遊戲影片公開！10月13日起正式參戰！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T11:19:16.164469+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1637,"images":30,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}